talic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.10. CIs were adjusted for clustering on children&#x02019;s school. Significant effect of UAs metabolites on cognition functions or PbB concentration &#x000d7; UAs interaction is shown in parentheses.</p></fn><fn id="tfn7-ehp0115-001371"><label>a</label><p>These cognitive tests were log-transformed to achieve the normal distribution. Beta coefficient significant at</p></fn><fn id="tfn8-ehp0115-001371"><label>*</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.1,</p></fn><fn id="tfn9-ehp0115-001371"><label>**</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05,</p></fn><fn id="tfn10-ehp0115-001371"><label>#</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>